    {
      "id": "p21",
      "theory": "理论出处：推导 PDF · Eq.10–Eq.11（Δ²_21(k,z) 与 P_21）。**代码根本不产出它**——它是分析层对 δT_b 的盒子做 k 空间统计得到的，所以图上它没有「看实现」入口（这一条已知，不是遗漏）。",
      "symbol": "P_21(k,z)",
      "name": "21cm 功率谱",
      "kind": "spectrum",
      "observable": true,
      "page": 6,
      "eq": "Eq.10–Eq.11",
      "formula": "Δ²_21(k,z) = k³/(2π²) · P_21(k,z)；P_21(k,z) = δT_b² [ μ⁴ P_δδ + 2μ² P_δx + P_xx ] + RSD 项",
      "dependsOn": ["dtb", "q_hii"],
      "nature": {
        "type": "功率谱（k–z 二维）",
        "homogeneity": "—",
        "coupling": "δT_b 与 x_HI 以乘积进入，两者独立演化",
        "nonlocal": "否",
        "degenerate": "否",
        "note": "μ 为波矢与视线夹角的余弦；不同 μ 对应不同物理主导尺度（电离泡 vs X 射线加热区）"
      },
      "sections": ["V 21 cm 亮温度", "VIII"],
      "codeHints": ["S15"],
      "reviewSection": "§4 涨落与功率谱（§4.1 红移空间畸变、§4.2 电离涨落）"
    },
    {
      "id": "phi_uv",
      "symbol": "φ(M_1500, z)",
      "name": "UV 光度函数（Schechter）",
      "kind": "function",
      "observable": true,
      "page": 7,
      "eq": "Eq.12–Eq.14",
      "formula": "φ(M_1500,z) = (ln10/2.5) · φ*(z) · 10^{0.4(α+1)(M*−M_1500)} · exp(−10^{0.4(M*−M_1500)})；φ*(z), M*(z), α(z) ← ρ̇*(z) = f* · f_coll(M_min(T_vir^min), z) · ρ̄_b；L_1500 = κ_UV Ṁ*(M_halo)，M_1500 = −2.5 log10(L_1500/L_28)",
      "dependsOn": ["fstar", "mmin", "rho_star"],
      "nature": {
        "type": "Schechter 解析式（指数 × 幂律）",
        "homogeneity": "高度非线性（截断处极灵敏）",
        "coupling": "与 x_HI、f*、ζ **无直接代数关联** ⇒ 关键作用是**打破 ζ·f* 简并**",
        "nonlocal": "否",
        "degenerate": "否（它是解简并的工具）"
      },
      "sections": ["VI UV 光度函数", "X 总结性数学性质表"],
      "codeHints": ["S04.1"],
      "reviewSection": "§3.6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tau_e",
      "symbol": "τ_e",
      "name": "汤姆森光深（标量）",
      "kind": "quantity",
      "observable": true,
      "page": 8,
      "eq": "Eq.15–Eq.17",
      "formula": "τ_e = σ_T n̄_H,0 c ∫_0^∞ (1 − x_HI(z)) · (1+z)² / H(z) dz",
      "dependsOn": ["q_hii"],
      "nature": {
        "type": "线性积分（全宇宙）",
        "homogeneity": "对 x_HI 线性齐次",
        "coupling": "无",
        "nonlocal": "是：整个宇宙历史上的积分",
        "degenerate": "是：不同 (ζ, f*, T_vir^min) 组合可给出相同 τ_e，但 x_HI(z) 历史不同",
        "note": "信息极度压缩：整条 x_HI 曲线压成单一标量；积分权重偏重高红移"
      },
      "sections": ["VII 汤姆森光深", "X 总结性数学性质表"],
      "codeHints": ["S04.2"],
      "reviewSection": "§3.2 全局信号的演化"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": {
    "note": "一级（主图）的划分依据：**天体物理过程**，不是代码阶段。一个过程 = 一组按等式串起来的量，能独立读懂。纪律：`nodes` + `drivers` 里每个物理量**恰好**属于一个块（不重不漏）；块内成员之间的边留到子图画，块间接口边留在主图画。**档位（tier）只是 y 坐标**：按因果层级手写（⓪最底 → ①晕 / ②阈值 → ③星系 → ④电离 → ⑤热 / ⑥Lyα → ⑦自旋 → ⑧亮温 → ⑨观测最顶），不改任何行为；逻辑一律靠边表达，页面不得把档位当筛选条件。`kind: band` 是「带」（成员互相之间没有块内边，进不去子图），`kind: process` 是「过程」（块内连通，可进入）。",
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "block:env",
        "tier": 0,
        "label": "⓪ 环境与给定",
        "kind": "band",
        "members": ["tgamma", "fstar", "k_target"],
        "note": "不是被推出来的，而是环境给的：CMB 温度 T_γ、恒星形成效率 f*、分析侧选定的目标波数 k。三者互不相干（T_γ 有 codeHints，另两个是输入参数），所以是「带」不是「过程」。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:hmf",
        "tier": 1,
        "label": "① 暗物质晕质量函数",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["hmf_impl", "dn_dm"],
        "note": "Eq.1 的被积函数 dn/dM 与它的算法（实现进子图）。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:mmin",
        "tier": 1,
        "label": "② 晕质量阈值",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["tvir_min", "mmin"],
        "note": "Eq.2：哪些晕能形成恒星。含 LW 与再电离反馈的修正。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:galaxy",
        "tier": 2,
        "label": "③ 星系形成与源项",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["scaling_relations", "rho_star", "source_grid"],
        "note": "Eq.1 / Eq.4 的公式流与算法流：标度关系把每晕属性给出来，积分成 ρ̇*，或直接铺成 3D 源项网格。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:ionization",
        "tier": 3,
        "label": "④ 电离史",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["zeta", "nion", "q_hii"],
        "note": "Eq.3 / Eq.4：光子产出率 → 电离分数。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:thermal",
        "tier": 4,
        "label": "⑤ 气体热史",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["lx", "eps_heat", "tk"],
        "note": "Eq.6 / Eq.7：X 射线加热率 → 气体动理学温度。输入来自 ④（电离反馈）与 ⓪（康普顿耦合）。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:lya",
        "tier": 4,
        "label": "⑥ Lyα 耦合",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["jalpha", "xalpha"],
        "note": "Eq.8：Lyα 背景 → 耦合系数（∝ 1/T_γ）。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:spin",
        "tier": 5,
        "label": "⑦ 自旋温度",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["xc", "ts"],
        "note": "Eq.5：碰撞耦合 → 自旋温度。输入来自 ⑤（T_K）、⑥（x_α）与 ⓪（T_γ）。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:dtb",
        "tier": 6,
        "label": "⑧ 亮温方程",
        "kind": "process",
        "members": ["dtb"],
        "note": "Eq.9：微分亮温。只有一个成员——它自己的实现细节（step:S15.1.*）要再进一层。"
      },
      {
        "id": "block:obs",
        "tier": 7,
        "label": "⑨ 观测量",
        "kind": "band",
        "members": ["p21", "phi_uv", "tau_e"],
        "note": "主链算完之后给出的可观测结果：21cm 功率谱 P_21、UV 光度函数 φ、光学深度 τ_e。三者各自挂在自己的上游上、互相之间没有边，所以是「带」不是「过程」。φ 与 τ_e 是诊断出口（原旁路阶段 S04），物理上仍属观测量。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "edges": [
    { "from": "tvir_min", "to": "mmin", "eq": "Eq.2", "page": 3 },
    { "from": "dn_dm", "to": "rho_star", "eq": "Eq.1", "page": 3, "note": "Eq.1 积分里的被积函数 dn/dM" },
    { "from": "fstar", "to": "scaling_relations", "eq": "Eq.1", "page": 3, "note": "幅度：恒星形成效率（USE_UPPER_STELLAR_TURNOVER 在这里改高质端的取值）" },
    { "from": "mmin", "to": "scaling_relations", "eq": "Eq.2", "page": 3, "note": "哪些晕能形成恒星：质量下限（含 LW 与再电离反馈，见 S12.1.2）" },
    { "from": "scaling_relations", "to": "rho_star", "eq": "Eq.1", "page": 3, "note": "经 dn/dM 积分回到体积平均：这一步才得到公式流的 ρ̇*" },
    { "from": "scaling_relations", "to": "source_grid", "eq": "Eq.4", "page": 3, "note": "每晕属性 → 3D 源项网格（ComputeHaloBox；USE_MINI_HALOS 在这里加迷你晕那一支）" },
    { "from": "source_grid", "to": "nion", "eq": "Eq.4", "page": 3, "note": "算法流：源项网格给出 Ṅ_ion（PHOTON_CONS_TYPE 改的就是这里）" },
    { "from": "zeta", "to": "nion", "eq": "Eq.4", "page": 3 },
    { "from": "fstar", "to": "nion", "eq": "Eq.4", "page": 3 },
    { "from": "rho_star", "to": "nion", "eq": "Eq.4", "page": 3, "note": "公式流：通过 dF_coll/dt。与上一条 source_grid→nion 是同一关系的两种表示（体积平均 vs 3D 网格）" },
    { "from": "nion", "to": "q_hii", "eq": "Eq.3", "page": 3 },
    { "from": "q_hii", "to": "eps_heat", "eq": "Eq.7", "page": 5, "note": "经 (1 − x_e) 项" },
    { "from": "lx", "to": "eps_heat", "eq": "Eq.7", "page": 5 },
    { "from": "eps_heat", "to": "tk", "eq": "Eq.6", "page": 5 },
    { "from": "tgamma", "to": "tk", "eq": "Eq.6", "page": 5, "note": "康普顿耦合项 Γ_Compton(T_γ − T_K)" },
    { "from": "rho_star", "to": "jalpha", "eq": "§4.3", "page": 5, "note": "J_α ∝ ρ̇*(z)" },
    { "from": "jalpha", "to": "xalpha", "eq": "Eq.8", "page": 5 },
    { "from": "tgamma", "to": "xalpha", "eq": "Eq.8", "page": 5, "note": "x_α ∝ 1/T_γ" },
    { "from": "tk", "to": "xc", "eq": "§IV", "page": 5 },
    { "from": "tgamma", "to": "ts", "eq": "Eq.5", "page": 4 },
    { "from": "xalpha", "to": "ts", "eq": "Eq.5", "page": 4 },
    { "from": "xc", "to": "ts", "eq": "Eq.5", "page": 4 },
    { "from": "tk", "to": "ts", "eq": "Eq.5", "page": 4 },
    { "from": "q_hii", "to": "dtb", "eq": "Eq.9", "page": 6 },
    { "from": "ts", "to": "dtb", "eq": "Eq.9", "page": 6 },
    { "from": "tgamma", "to": "dtb", "eq": "Eq.9", "page": 6 },
    { "from": "dtb", "to": "p21", "eq": "Eq.11", "page": 6 },
    { "from": "q_hii", "to": "p21", "eq": "Eq.11", "page": 6, "note": "经 P_xx 项" },
    { "from": "fstar", "to": "phi_uv", "eq": "Eq.13", "page": 7 },
    { "from": "mmin", "to": "phi_uv", "eq": "Eq.13", "page": 7, "note": "经 f_coll(M_min)" },
    { "from": "rho_star", "to": "phi_uv", "eq": "Eq.13", "page": 7 },
    { "from": "q_hii", "to": "tau_e", "eq": "Eq.17", "page": 8 },
    { "from": "k_target", "to": "p21", "eq": "Eq.11", "page": 6, "note": "P_21 是「指定波数处的功率谱」：Eq.11 的 P_21(k) 必须先有 k。原先缺这条边，k 成了零边孤立节点（k 不在 inputs.py 里，是分析侧自选波数，见 drivers 里的说明）" },
    { "from": "hmf_impl", "to": "dn_dm", "eq": "Eq.1 的实现", "page": 3, "note": "dn/dM 怎么被算出来（传输函数 → 方差 → 质量函数公式）。原先缺这条边，hmf_impl 成了零边孤立节点" }
  ],
  "params": {
    "note": "代码参数（wrapper/inputs.py）。命名政策：**物理量在图上按 P&L 2012 的写法显示**（不追代码变量名），这里只记「代码里叫什么 ↔ P&L 叫什么」与来源论文。`paper` 只填代码注释里真实写着的出处（见 docs/notes/physics-chain/papers.md）；没有的一律留空——论文以后再做打算，不编。`switch: true` 表示它是「控制计算时要不要考虑某个效应」的开关。",
    "order": ["drivers", "astro", "cosmo", "numeric", "effects"],
    "cosmo": [
      { "name": "hlittle" },
      { "name": "OMm" },
      { "name": "OMb" },
      { "name": "OMn" },
      { "name": "OMk" },
      { "name": "OMr" },
      { "name": "OMtot" },
      { "name": "Y_He" },
      { "name": "wl" },
      { "name": "m22" },
      { "name": "POWER_INDEX" },
      { "name": "A_s" }
    ],
    "astro": [
      { "name": "A_LW" },
      { "name": "A_VCB" },
      { "name": "ALPHA_ESC" },
      { "name": "ALPHA_STAR_MINI" },
      { "name": "ALPHA_UVB" },
      { "name": "BETA_LW" },
      { "name": "BETA_VCB" },
      { "name": "CLUMPING_FACTOR" },
      { "name": "DELTA_R_HII_FACTOR" },
      { "name": "FIXED_VAVG" },
      { "name": "F_ESC7_MINI" },
      { "name": "F_H2_SHIELD" },
      { "name": "F_STAR7_MINI" },
      { "name": "L_X_MINI" },
      { "name": "MAX_DVDR" },
      { "name": "NU_X_BAND_MAX" },
      { "name": "NU_X_MAX" },
      { "name": "NU_X_THRESH" },
      { "name": "POP3_ION" },
      { "name": "R_BUBBLE_MAX" },
      { "name": "R_BUBBLE_MIN" },
      { "name": "SIGMA_LX" },
      { "name": "SIGMA_SFR_INDEX" },
      { "name": "SIGMA_SFR_LIM" },
      { "name": "SIGMA_STAR" },
      { "name": "T_RE" },
      { "name": "UPPER_STELLAR_TURNOVER_INDEX" },
      { "name": "UPPER_STELLAR_TURNOVER_MASS" },
      { "name": "X_RAY_SPEC_INDEX" }
    ],
    "drivers": [
      { "name": "F_STAR10", "pl2012": "f*", "role": "驱动量：恒星形成效率（10^10 M⊙ 晕）", "default": -1.3, "log10": true, "range": [-3, 0], "paper": "Park+2018（inputs.py 的 F_STAR10 段：See Eq. 11 of Greig+2018 and Sec 2.1 of Park+2018）" },
      { "name": "F_ESC10", "pl2012": "f_esc", "role": "驱动量：逃逸分数（10^10 M⊙ 晕）", "default": -1, "log10": true, "range": null, "paper": "Greig+2018 / Park+2018（同上一段）" },
      { "name": "HII_EFF_FACTOR", "pl2012": "ζ", "role": "驱动量：综合电离效率", "default": 30, "log10": false, "range": [0, null], "paper": "Greig+2015（inputs.py：zeta, from Eq. 2 of Greig+2015）" },
      { "name": "POP2_ION", "pl2012": "N_ion", "role": "驱动量：每重子电离光子数", "default": 5000, "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" },
      { "name": "M_TURN", "pl2012": "M_turn / T_vir^min 的替代", "role": "驱动量：抑制恒星形成的转折质量", "default": 8.7, "log10": true, "range": [0, null], "paper": "Park+2018（inputs.py 的 M_TURN 段：See Sec 2.1 of Park+2018）" },
      { "name": "L_X", "pl2012": "L_X", "role": "驱动量：X 射线光度（每单位恒星形成率）", "default": null, "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" },
      { "name": "ION_Tvir_MIN", "pl2012": "T_vir^min", "role": "驱动量：最小维里温度（旧参数化）", "default": null, "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" },
      { "name": "ALPHA_STAR", "pl2012": "f* 的旧参数化", "role": "驱动量：恒星形成效率（旧参数化）", "default": null, "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "Scoccimarro R., 1998, MNRAS, 299, 1097-1118（同一输入结构里引作 ZA/参数说明的共同出处，仅此一处可查）" }
    ],
    "numeric": [
      { "name": "R_MAX_TS", "pl2012": "—", "role": "数值：自旋温度滤波半径（Mpc）", "default": 500, "log10": false, "range": [0, null], "paper": "" },
      { "name": "N_STEP_TS", "pl2012": "—", "role": "数值：自旋温度壳层数", "default": 40, "log10": false, "range": [0, null], "paper": "" },
      { "name": "PHOTONCONS_CALIBRATION_END", "pl2012": "—", "role": "数值：光子守恒校准的终止红移", "default": 3.5, "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" },
      { "name": "INTEGRATION_METHOD_ATOMIC", "pl2012": "—", "role": "数值：原子晕条件质量函数积分法", "default": "GAUSS-LEGENDRE", "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" },
      { "name": "INTEGRATION_METHOD_MINI", "pl2012": "—", "role": "数值：迷你晕条件质量函数积分法", "default": "GAUSS-LEGENDRE", "log10": false, "range": null, "paper": "" }
    ],
    "effects": [
      {
        "name": "USE_TS_FLUCT",
        "pl2012": "自旋温度涨落（P&L §4.3 耦合涨落）",
        "role": "效应开关：要不要把自旋温度当独立场算（含 HaloBox 的源项分支）",
        "default": false,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "",
        "gatesEdges": ["ts->dtb"],
        "basis": "code（读点在 HaloBox.c:77,142,173,223,278,410 与 BrightnessTemperatureBox.c:75——**不在 SpinTemperatureBox**；docstring: Whether to perform IGM spin temperature fluctuations）。2026-09-29 对照代码后修正：原先误挂在 eps_heat->tk"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_X_RAY_HEATING",
        "pl2012": "X 射线加热（P&L §3.4）",
        "role": "效应开关：要不要考虑 X 射线加热",
        "default": true,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "",
        "gatesEdges": ["eps_heat->tk"],
        "basis": "code（读点全在 SpinTemperatureBox.c:150,267,1242,1536,1703,1764,1812；docstring: Whether to include X-ray heating）"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_CMB_HEATING",
        "pl2012": "（P&L 2012 未含）",
        "role": "效应开关：要不要考虑 CMB 加热",
        "default": true,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "Meiksin 2021, arXiv:2105.14516（inputs.py:1026）",
        "gatesEdges": ["tgamma->tk"],
        "basis": "code（读点仅 SpinTemperatureBox.c:1248，那里正是 CMB/康普顿加热项；docstring 引 Meiksin 2021 Eq.4）"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_LYA_HEATING",
        "pl2012": "Ly-α 加热（P&L §2.3 相关）",
        "role": "效应开关：要不要考虑 Ly-α 加热",
        "default": true,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "Reis+2021, doi:10.1093/mnras/stab2089（inputs.py:1028）",
        "gatesEdges": ["eps_heat->tk"],
        "basis": "code（读点在 SpinTemperatureBox.c:150,156,166,175,252,260,276,472 等；docstring 引 Reis+2021 Sec.3）。它作用于自旋温度盒内部的加热项，图上挂在最近的加热边上"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_EXP_FILTER",
        "pl2012": "（P&L 2012 未含）",
        "role": "效应开关：电离发射率用 MFP 指数滤波",
        "default": true,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "Davies & Furlanetto 2021（inputs.py:1051,1055）",
        "gatesEdges": ["nion->q_hii"],
        "basis": "code（IonisationBox.c:614：filter_hf = USE_EXP_FILTER ? 3 : consts->hii_filter —— 换的是电离盒里的滤波核；docstring 引 Davies & Furlanetto 2021）"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_MINI_HALOS",
        "pl2012": "（P&L 2012 未含）",
        "role": "效应开关：要不要考虑迷你晕（Pop III）",
        "default": false,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "Qin+2020（inputs.py 的 USE_MINI_HALOS 说明段）",
        "gatesEdges": ["rho_star->nion"],
        "basis": "code（读点在 HaloBox.c:85,135,176,185,220,235,270，与 USE_TS_FLUCT 并列；docstring 要求同时开 USE_TS_FLUCT/INHOMO_RECO）。**已证实改源项**。2026-09-29 改挂：挂回**表面**那条公式关系 `ρ̇* → Ṅ_ion`；它在代码上落在哪一段（离散晕累加 / 条件积分表）属子图，见 `source_grid` 的 choices"
      },
      {
        "name": "USE_UPPER_STELLAR_TURNOVER",
        "pl2012": "（P&L 2012 未含）",
        "role": "效应开关：高质端恒星形成效率转折",
        "default": true,
        "switch": true,
        "paper": "",
        "gatesEdges": ["fstar->scaling_relations"],
        "basis": "code（scaling_relations.c:306,336 —— 落在恒星标度关系那一支，即 f* 的取值；2026-09-29 扩链后该支独立成节点，挂点随新边从 fstar->rho_star 移到 fstar->scaling_relations）"
      },
      {
        "name": "PHOTON_CONS_TYPE",
        "pl2012": "（P&L 2012 未含）",
